{"mode": "fresh", "model": "haiku", "effort": "low", "wall_s": 5.87, "api_ms": 5063, "duration_ms": 5547, "is_error": false, "structured": {"commentary": "White's exd5 attacks Nc6. Options: Nxd5 recaptures the pawn with the knight defended by Qd8, centralizing and keeping material level. Qxd5 is loose and hangs to Bxd5 or Nc3 tempo ideas. Retreats like Ne7 or Nd4 give up the centre. Nxd5 is the most principled choice, and the Ng5 is poking at f7.", "move": "Nxd5", "note": "Plan: keep the d5 knight defended by Qd8, then develop and castle. Expect 6.Bxd5 Qxd5 or 6.Nxf7 Kxf7 7.Bxd5+ Qxd5 with Black ahead."}, "legal": true, "input_tokens": 2322, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2320, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 930, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 612}, "server_tool_use": {"web_search_requests": 0, "web_fetch_requests": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 2320, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "inference_geo": "global", "iterations": [{"input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 930, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2320, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 2320}, "type": "message"}], "speed": "standard", "fallback_credit": null}, "first": {"system": 0.371, "message_start": 1.394, "content_block_start": 1.394, "thinking_delta": 1.596, "signature_delta": 4.543, "assistant": 4.545, "content_block_stop": 4.545, "input_json_delta": 4.546, "user": 5.862, "message_delta": 5.863, "message_stop": 5.863, "rate_limit_event": 5.865, "result": 5.87}, "at": 1793938139.77674}
{"mode": "fresh", "model": "opus", "effort": "low", "wall_s": 4.556, "api_ms": 3505, "duration_ms": 4168, "is_error": false, "structured": {"commentary": "This is the Two Knights Defence. Nxd5 lets White play Nxf7 or d4, which are dangerous attacks, so I'm avoiding it. I'm choosing between Na5 (main line), Nd4 (Fritz Variation) and b5 (Ulvestad Variation), and I'm going with Na5. It attacks the bishop on c4, and I'm giving up a pawn to get quick development.", "move": "Na5", "note": "Plan: answer Bb5+ with c6, then after dxc6 bxc6 move the bishop away and play h6 to kick the knight. I'm giving up a pawn to get active pieces. Expect Bb5+."}, "legal": true, "input_tokens": 2297, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2295, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 317, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 14}, "server_tool_use": {"web_search_requests": 0, "web_fetch_requests": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 2295, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "inference_geo": "global", "iterations": [{"input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 317, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2295, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 2295}, "type": "message"}], "speed": "standard", "fallback_credit": null}, "first": {"system": 1.025, "message_start": 1.749, "content_block_start": 1.749, "thinking_delta": 2.283, "signature_delta": 2.283, "assistant": 2.285, "content_block_stop": 2.285, "input_json_delta": 2.285, "user": 4.545, "message_delta": 4.547, "message_stop": 4.547, "rate_limit_event": 4.548, "result": 4.556}, "at": 1793938145.8043408}
{"mode": "fresh", "model": "opus", "effort": "medium", "wall_s": 5.676, "api_ms": 4988, "duration_ms": 5258, "is_error": false, "structured": {"commentary": "I compared 5...Nxd5 and 5...Na5. Taking with the knight walks into 6.Nxf7, the Fried Liver Attack, or 6.d4, the Lolli Attack, where White gets a strong attack on my king. 5...Na5 is the main line. It gives up a pawn to move the knight off c6, where the d5 pawn attacks it, and it hits the bishop on c4. I get quick development and active play.", "move": "Na5", "note": "Main line of the Two Knights Defense. After 6.Bb5+ c6 7.dxc6 bxc6 8.Be2 h6 9.Nf3 e4 10.Ne5, I play ...Bd6 or ...Qc7 and use my lead in development. Expect Bb5+"}, "legal": true, "input_tokens": 2299, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 325, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1972, "output_tokens": 487, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 32}, "server_tool_use": {"web_search_requests": 0, "web_fetch_requests": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 325, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "inference_geo": "global", "iterations": [{"input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 487, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1972, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 325, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 325}, "type": "message"}], "speed": "standard", "fallback_credit": null}, "first": {"system": 0.487, "message_start": 1.371, "content_block_start": 1.371, "thinking_delta": 1.606, "signature_delta": 1.606, "assistant": 1.609, "content_block_stop": 1.609, "text_delta": 1.609, "input_json_delta": 3.043, "user": 5.657, "message_delta": 5.659, "message_stop": 5.659, "rate_limit_event": 5.661, "result": 5.676}, "at": 1793939513.6528182}
